sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant E as Elysia route
    participant PG as Postgres
    participant Q as RabbitMQ
    participant K as In-process consumer
    participant R as Rust smpp service
    participant S as SMSC

    C->>E: POST /api/sms/v1/smpp/send
    E->>E: hasAuth macro (x-api-key or session)
    E->>E: valibot MessageBodySchema
    E->>PG: insert message (scheduled=true)
    E->>PG: insert message_smpp
    E->>PG: insert message_status_history SCHEDULED
    E-->>C: 201 Created
    E->>Q: sendToQueue(AMQP_SMPP_QUEUE, JSON batch)
    Q->>K: deliver batch
    K->>PG: claim row (scheduled true to false)
    K->>PG: insert history PENDING
    K->>Q: sendToQueue(AMQP_QUEUE, protobuf Message)
    K->>PG: insert history SENT or FAILED
    Q->>R: deliver protobuf
    R->>S: submit_sm (registered_delivery=all)
